pkmjson records facts about sealed Pokémon TCG products: what a product contains, the names it was sold under,
and when. Each release lists the pages its facts come from in `sources`. No text, description or image from those
pages is copied into the data.

Poképédia (https://www.pokepedia.fr) is the source of many French release names and dates. Its text is licensed
CC BY-NC-SA 3.0. pkmjson takes only facts from it (the official French product name, its release date, and which
booster packs a French box holds when they differ from the English box), never Poképédia's text, and credits the
page each one comes from. The pages are read through Poképédia's MediaWiki API.

Set logos in sets/sets.json are links to images on TCGdex, pokemon.com and pokemon-card.com, not copies. Those
images and the Pokémon names and marks belong to Nintendo, Creatures Inc. and GAME FREAK inc. Anyone who displays
them is responsible for having the right to.
